  A staged run is NOT the gate and says so on its first line. The gate is
  both viewports, every part — see the cost of that with no arguments.
  File what you ran: node tools/dev-smoke-state.mjs record <log>
  And redirect to a FILE, not a pipe: node block-buffers stdout to a pipe,
  so a piped smoke log stays at zero bytes until the process exits — which
  is how a run at 41 minutes was killed one minute from its finish (T-0235).
